            {
                "comment": "Fantastic lectures, interesting readings, challenging but meaningful assignment. And good taste in terms of outfit !",
                "difficulty_rating": 2,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Very knowledgeable and professional, yet unexpectedly humorous. Really, REALLY knows her material. Virtually never use the textbook (she says she's in the process of writing one that suits the needs of the class), but nice for supplemental reading. If I could do it over, I would take this class again.",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
